@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F6F7F8
skinparam activityBorderColor #222222
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #D0EDFA
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #3D8DFF
skinparam ArrowColor #3D8DFF

start
:Capture or match customer;
:Resolve golden account and legal entity;
:Create opportunity and select selling entity;
:Configure products from governed catalogue;
:Apply price book, tier, ramp and term rules;
:Calculate ARR, MRR, one-time revenue and TCV;
:Validate completeness and commercial policy;
if (Approval required?) then (yes)
  :Create approval plan with reasons;
  :Resolve approvers by persona;
  :Lock commercial values;
  :Collect ordered or parallel decisions;
  if (Approved?) then (yes)
    :Unlock for controlled progression;
  else (no)
    :Return with decision and correction guidance;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
endif
:Generate customer-facing proposal;
:Capture acceptance and signature;
:Create governed contract and contract lines;
:Publish order and billing events through integration layer;
:Reconcile downstream acknowledgements and financial actuals;
:Expose customer, pipeline, contract and revenue reporting;
stop
@enduml
